{"3856650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SNEAKALOT", "steam_appid": 3856650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SNEAKALOT is a single player open world stealth mission game where you play as an activist on a mission to expose a corrupt &amp; brutal military government. Navigate a military invaded and torn city, with lots of soldiers stationed and dynamically patrolling making every gameplay experience unique. You could whistle, throw stones, set off a car alarm to distract soldiers. You can hide in tall bushes, in lockers, under large vehicles or in a garbage bin to conceal yourself but take into account every sound you make. Soldiers can hear you. From your footsteps to the type of surfaces you walk on, to the possibility of a car alarm getting triggered if you sneak too close. DON'T GET CAUGHT.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stealth Approach</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/95735602e74c113b040bbabff60ba006.poster.avif?t=1781292822\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/95735602e74c113b040bbabff60ba006.webm?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/95735602e74c113b040bbabff60ba006.mp4?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whistle, throw stones or set off car alarm to distract soldiers so as to make way or get away from a tough situation. Be a master of stealth and deception, know when to run and not to run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Your Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/f6f5e8c2920871311aa5eeabd1a6ba2a.poster.avif?t=1781292822\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/f6f5e8c2920871311aa5eeabd1a6ba2a.webm?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/f6f5e8c2920871311aa5eeabd1a6ba2a.mp4?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of objects around you can be used to conceal yourself, from the tall bushes to the garbage bin, lockers and large vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/20bb57b63b1f0a80f9a28ff30cae47af.poster.avif?t=1781292822\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/20bb57b63b1f0a80f9a28ff30cae47af.webm?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/20bb57b63b1f0a80f9a28ff30cae47af.mp4?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast, think smart. Running is not always the best decision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Always Scan Your Surroundings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/13329bde94d9d3d0220f32df601b8d9e.poster.avif?t=1781292822\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/13329bde94d9d3d0220f32df601b8d9e.webm?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/13329bde94d9d3d0220f32df601b8d9e.mp4?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always scan your surroundings for places to hide and for the perfect path to follow. The path you follow will determine your survival. Use objects in your surrounding to your advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch Your Every Step</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/69d9a5d83c9a6ee8017544e36f30e960.poster.avif?t=1781292822\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/69d9a5d83c9a6ee8017544e36f30e960.webm?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/69d9a5d83c9a6ee8017544e36f30e960.mp4?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soldiers are always at alert and always listening. Your every step counts, objects all around you could either help you or work against you. From the sound of the surface you walk on to the items you collide with, watch your steps. Stay quiet, stay hidden. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong> : <strong>Grab your headset</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Snooze, You DIE !</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/8f2430a8657844c5fa74d10ee1b58a01.poster.avif?t=1781292822\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/8f2430a8657844c5fa74d10ee1b58a01.webm?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/8f2430a8657844c5fa74d10ee1b58a01.mp4?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They take no prisoners. Do not get caught. You snooze, you DIE !</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SNEAKALOT is a single player open world stealth mission game where you play as an activist on a mission to expose a corrupt &amp; brutal military government. Navigate a military invaded and torn city, with lots of soldiers stationed and dynamically patrolling making every gameplay experience unique. You could whistle, throw stones, set off a car alarm to distract soldiers. You can hide in tall bushes, in lockers, under large vehicles or in a garbage bin to conceal yourself but take into account every sound you make. Soldiers can hear you. From your footsteps to the type of surfaces you walk on, to the possibility of a car alarm getting triggered if you sneak too close. DON'T GET CAUGHT.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stealth Approach</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/95735602e74c113b040bbabff60ba006.poster.avif?t=1781292822\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/95735602e74c113b040bbabff60ba006.webm?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/95735602e74c113b040bbabff60ba006.mp4?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whistle, throw stones or set off car alarm to distract soldiers so as to make way or get away from a tough situation. Be a master of stealth and deception, know when to run and not to run.</p><h2 class=\"b