eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/13329bde94d9d3d0220f32df601b8d9e.webm?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/13329bde94d9d3d0220f32df601b8d9e.mp4?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always scan your surroundings for places to hide and for the perfect path to follow. The path you follow will determine your survival. Use objects in your surrounding to your advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch Your Every Step</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/69d9a5d83c9a6ee8017544e36f30e960.poster.avif?t=1781292822\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/69d9a5d83c9a6ee8017544e36f30e960.webm?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/69d9a5d83c9a6ee8017544e36f30e960.mp4?t=1781292822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soldiers are always at alert and always listening. Your every step counts, objects all around you could either help you or work against you. From the sound of the surface you walk on to the items you collide with, watch your steps. Stay quiet, stay hidden. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong> : <strong>Grab your headset</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Snooze, You DIE !</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856650/extras/8f2430a8657844c5fa74d10ee1b58a01.poster.avif?t=1781292822\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"htt